{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/number-bases/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/number-bases.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Number Bases — binary, hex, conversions","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Number Bases</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Place values</h2><div class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">In base b, digits represent powers of b. Example: 1101₂ = 1×8 + 1×4 + 0×2 + 1×1 = 13.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Place-value SVG</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700\">Binary digits map to 2^n places.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"340\" height=\"60\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"10\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\">1101₂ → [8][4][2][1]</text></svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) Convert 255 (dec) to hex</div><input id=\"b1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., FF\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"bc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"bh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"bfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) Add binary: 1011 + 1101 = ?</div><input id=\"b2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 11000\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"bc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"bh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"bfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"bQuiz\" class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quick Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"bModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"bContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"bClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-teal-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .mono{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}